           PERFORM DPP12-MCB-INIT     THRU DPP12-MCB-INIT-EXIT. 
           PERFORM DPP12-BEGIN-THREAD THRU DPP12-BEGIN-THREAD-EXIT. 

           IF  DPP01-SQL-ERROR-IND = 'Y'
               GO TO DPP12-THREAD-ERROR-EXIT
           END-IF.  

           EXEC SQL USE DEFAULT SCHEMA PSTRDMS END-EXEC.

           EXEC SQL WHENEVER SQLERROR   
                GO TO 9150-RDMS-ERROR   
           END-EXEC.

           EXEC SQL WHENEVER NOT FOUND  
                CONTINUE
           END-EXEC.

       0100-INIT-DATABASE.  
           MOVE 2 TO FETCH-WITH-LOCK
